            "Enter the number of cities: 4\n",
            "Enter the cost matrix (row by row): \n",
            "0 10 15 20\n",
            "10 0 35 25\n",
            "15 35 0 30\n",
            "20 25 30 0\n",
            "Enter the starting city (0 to 3): 0\n",
            "\n",
            "Optimal path: 0 -> 1 -> 3 -> 2 -> 0\n",
            "Minimum cost: 80\n"
          ]
